2026-09-17 overview additions: native HTTP status is readable; non-2xx responses
are not counted as successful probes. GitHub and Grok resource paths use robots.txt
because the upstream generate_204/favicon.ico targets returned 404. Taobao uses
the fixed Alibaba CDN icon to which its favicon redirects. No redirects or scripts
are followed. Brand favicon assets are bundled locally with their own source notice.

