2026-09-17 AI response correction: compared src/views/ai/probe.ts and
src/lib/network.ts (request opaque mode). Non-trace AI probes now finish when
HTTP headers arrive, without waiting for the favicon body. Unlike an opaque
browser response, native HTTP can retain the status code: restricted/redirect
responses keep their measured latency and remain distinct from transport failure.
